- **Frontend**: Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- **Backend**: Node.js, Express, WebSocket (ws)
- **Database**: PostgreSQL with Prisma ORM
- **Authentication**: Stack Auth
- **Deployment**: Docker, Docker Compose

